{"about_the_game":"Coyote: An Old West Vignette is a tiny point-and-click adventure game about a gruff marshall on the trail of a deadly outlaw. It leads him to a saloon in a near-deserted ghost town, where the remaining patrons offer opportunities to bring this gunslinger to justice. But along the way, it becomes less clear who the real outlaw is...<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A quick 15-minute snack of a game<br></li><li> Drenched in spaghetti-western atmosphere<br></li><li> Dark humorous tone<br></li><li> Hand-drawn 2D characters<br></li><li> Navigate quirky dialogues and shoot pesky locks<br></li><li> Multiple ways to achieve your goal<br></li><li> Full keyboard and controller support</li></ul><br>Cast:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dylan Nagel as the Coyote<br></li><li> Antonio Mena as the Desperado\u200b<br></li><li> Aimee Smith as Eleonor<br></li><li> Sean Chiplock as the Bartender<br></li><li> Edwyn Tiong as the Mysterious Stranger</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2888030?t=1741087168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741087168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888030/03011d4ee5a4a6154b53344aae46d6fd3cf9784a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741087168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888030/03011d4ee5a4a6154b53344aae46d6fd3cf9784a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741087168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some cursing, references to stealing, and other old west crime-related activities."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Coyote: An Old West Vignette is a tiny point-and-click adventure game about a gruff marshall on the trail of a deadly outlaw. It leads him